# Paper files: local copies only. Many licenses (e.g. arXiv non-exclusive) don't permit redistribution.
# Integrity is tracked by sha256 in research/papers/registry.json.
research/papers/pdf/
research/papers/md/
research/papers/txt/
research/papers/.build.log
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Experiment artifacts (checkpoints, large outputs): hashes are recorded in each RUN.md
experiments/runs/*/artifacts/

# LaTeX build by-products (the .bib copy is regenerated from research/papers/references.bib)
pitch/*/build.out
pitch/*/main.log
pitch/roadmap/roadmap.log
pitch/brief/brief.log
pitch/*/main.xdv
pitch/*/references.bib
pitch/*/main.blg

# hyperresearch (2026-10-17): the local vault and the installed step skills are regenerable
# (`hyperresearch init`, `hyperresearch install --steps-only`). Fetched source notes and raw pages hold
# full text of web pages and papers (licences, as for research/papers/pdf); only our own reports and
# run artifacts are committed.
.hyperresearch/
.claude/skills/hyperresearch-*/
research/raw/
research/notes/*.md
!research/notes/final_report_*.md
research/runs/*/temp/hplt-html/
